{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/HEADER_-_TEXTO.jpg?t=1750853307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Underpacked! you\u00b4ll have the best delivery crew at your side, but keep in mind you\u00b4ll never be alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play alone or with friends and enjoy both the chaotic journey and the joys of workplace exploitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/prepare__1_.png?t=1750853307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The whole galaxy is waiting for your deliveries! Assemble your orders so you can ship them across space. Pick them up and paint them to get them ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/prepara_con_marco.gif?t=1750853307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a package and customize it to match the recipient\u2019s request and remember: every package matters and ink is to expensive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/paquetes.png?t=1750853307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/defend.png?t=1750853307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out! Space is full of enemies, but don\u00b4t worry, your boss has given you just enough resources to protect yourselves.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load up the turret and shoot to defend the ship, but don\u00b4t forget: the package is what matters, and workers are replaceable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/Enemigo_Estrella-marco.gif?t=1750853307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/deliver.png?t=1750853307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure you\u00b4ve got the right package ready to go. Load into the turret and launch it at the right target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim carefully, don't send it to the wrong galaxy, deliveries depend on you\u2026 and a bit of luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/entrega_con_marco.gif?t=1750853307\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/descripcion_eng.png?t=1750853307\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Thank you for trusting in our efficiency and quality. See you in the next galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/sobre_Sello.png?t=1750853307\" 